menu "Muse todo display"

    config TODO_DISPLAY
        bool "Todo display screen and todo.* commands"
        depends on MUSE_ENABLED
        default n
        help
            The desk todo display (github.com/MaxTolan/muse-todo-display):
            replaces the avatar with the todo screen once paired, and adds
            the todo.set_list and todo.show_message commands for Muse.

endmenu
